window.products.push({"id":701084,"name":"ODSD Mini Bag Sealer, 2 IN 1 Heat Sealer & Cutter Battery Powered, Portable Handheld Bag Resealer Vacuum Sealer Saver Machine Kitchen Gadget for Chip ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yozpRgt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keeps Food Fresh： ODSD mini bag sealer creates a good seal and the contents stay airtight and kept from getting stale. Keep your food crisp and fresh with this heat sealer that will seal your snacks shut using heat. Would definitely recommend adding to your kitchen gadgets. Fun to Use： As a great hack for keeping snacks fresh in the pantry, this multifunctional little home gadget is great for sealing or resealing bags of chips, cookies, snack, cereal, pasta etc. Also can use it for crafts too with beads and glitter! Chips, cookies, and bread stay as fresh as the first time you opened the bag. Really seals bags & keeps them fresher than clips. Quick & Easy Way to Reseal Bags：Use the chip heat sealer machine on chip/snack bags when you can’t finish them or if you are planning on only eating part of the food. Come aim handy after the kids open a snack and don’t want to finish it off. Simply seal it for later, and also has a cutter to open them. Magnet On Back for Easy Storage： Equipped with a magnet so you can easily stick this portable resealer to the refrigerator or it’s small enough to store in a drawer easily. Also you can keep it on a hook next to the chips. This handheld sealer powered by two AA batteries (Battery is Included). Package Included & Warranty：Come with 1 x Mini Bag Heat Sealer, 2 x AA Battery, 1 x Use Manual. Any issue on product, please don’t hesitate to contact us, we will response you ASAP and provide the solution for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yozpRgt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ODSD","source_asin":"B0C6QGBGS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6QGBGS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6QGBGS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":701085,"name":"PEACE NEST Goose Feather Pillows for Sleeping, 100% Cotton Cover, Quatrefoil Quilted, King Size (2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51B+inkH2sL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Size:King This classic feather and down pillow is specially designed with 100% cotton which with quilted quatrefoil print pattern.This goose feather and down pillow is specially designed with double layered cotton fabric to avoid the prick feel of feather, so even sensitive sleepers can enjoy a cozy, restful sleep. Package- each pair vacuum packed and sealed in a beautiful zippered package with insert. Note:down and feather-filled products are packed tightly during shipping.Upon receipt,remove them from their packaging, fluff gently,and allow several hours to recover their full loft.In additiion,being sealed in plastic packaging,sometimes cause the scent of these natural products to concertrate to a disaggressable level,A few hours of airing usually removes the odor.Care Instruction-Machine wash, dry, and fluff.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51B+inkH2sL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peace nest","source_asin":"B01HXUG2ME","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HXUG2ME","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HXUG2ME","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
