window.products.push({"id":701161,"name":"GWiz Pick a Size from 24” to 88” KNOBLESS, Decorator Style, Poplar Wood, Wall Quilt Hanger(Black, 42)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910I6fowlQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you have been looking for a way to display a wall hanging or a treasured quilt, look no further!  Our quilt hanger works like a large clamp, holding the textile securely  without the need for sewing on tabs or putting holes in the material.  Our KNOBLESS Style type of hangers use 2 pieces of wood compressed together  by special screws which are inserted thru the back of the rear bar into the front bar. Hanger is custom made to fit your quilt. It seems the majority of our customers and quilters find that adding 2-3” to the length of your quilt, tapestry or rug was the best length for a hanger.  We sell our hangers in 2\" increments. Example 1: If your quilt is 45\" wide, get a hanger that is 48\" Example 2: If your quilt is 60\" wide, get a hanger that is 62\" Our EXCLUSIVE binding groove is located on both inner (lower) edges to hold  the Quilt Binding, thereby ensuring a uniform even hang. This Binding groove eases the pressure required to hold the textile in place and it will also eliminate slippage.Your Quilt does not come in contact with the clamping screws and will NOT put holes in you quilt. No sleeves are necessary on your quilt.Since 1999, GWiz Wood Products has been handcrafting the highest quality quilt displays, available today. We are the leaders in innovation, application, and we take pride in our exceptional handcrafted quality. We look forward to receiving and completing your order","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910I6fowlQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GWiz","source_asin":"B078T2WGW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078T2WGW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078T2WGW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
