window.products.push({"id":701330,"name":"Balance Living Buckwheat Pillow Travel Size 14”x 20”, 100% Organic Japanese Style","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H4LEpR0tL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"A 14”x 20” Travel Size Balance Living Japanese Buckwheat Pillow consists of a zippered 100% cotton material pillow cover filled with 100% organic buckwheat hulls. The buckwheat is a flowering plant grown in Asia and North America, with triangular shell-like hulls. The plant’s kernel are cultivated, organically, to meet the highest quality. They're referred to as hulls, husks or seeds. Adjust Balance Living Buckwheat pillow to your sleeping needs: - For those looking for an extra firm pillow, use the Balance Living Buckwheat Pillow as is and enjoy extra support of the head, neck and spine. Those who prefer a softer, more malleable pillow will conveniently reduce the amount of filling. - Carefully, unzip the pillow cover and simply scoop out buckwheat hulls. Place the excess hulls into a re-sealable plastic bag and store in a cool dry place. We recommend that you do not discard or refrigerate the unused buckwheat husks as you may want to re-adjust your pillow in the future. Care Instructions: - Exercise caution near a flammable element such as cigarettes. - Empty the pillow cover before washing. DO NOT wash the pillow with the buckwheat hulls inside. - Balance Living Pillow Case (Sold Separately) is specifically intended for use with our Japanese Buckwheat Pillows. Unmatched Performance. Improves Sleep Quality: The temperature-regulating pillow is designed to cradle and support the head, neck and spine throughout the night. Many have raved about the lowering and even disappearing of symptoms ranging from discomfort to full blown pain. Fend off sleep-depriving ailments whether you are a back or side sleeper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H4LEpR0tL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Balance Living","source_asin":"B00LMEW5VK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LMEW5VK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LMEW5VK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
