window.products.push({"id":701342,"name":"TURBRO Firelake 27-Inch Electric Fireplace Heater - Freestanding Fireplace with Mantel, No Assembly Required - 7 Adjustable Flame Effects, Overheating","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Au9gXKtcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥Delicate Home Decor: With a modern and classic combination wood box surrounded, the FL27-BW fireplace not only delivers warmth but also adds a touch of elegance to your room. With a three-sided glass, you and your family can enjoy the ambiance of dancing flames from any view in the room. 🔥Efficient Zone Heater: Firelake 1400W heater provides efficient supplemental zone heating for a small living room, bedroom, dining room, etc. The temperature can be adjusted from 62 - 82℉ and you can also use the 6-Hour timer function to program the running time of the heater. 🔥Gorgeous Lighting Effects: Watching the flickering dancing flame projects to the imitation brick wall background brings you the feeling of sitting by a real fireplace. The flame can be switched among 6 colors or run all the colors in a cycle automatically, and also can be turned on separately from the heat to help you set the mood when the heater is not needed. 🔥Integration Design: This FL27-BW mantel fireplace is delivered in fully-assembled condition. Choose a favorite location to settle down this fireplace and decorate it with the festive decorating per your mood. Let it become the warmest corner in your home. 🔥Safety Protection: The whole exterior stays cool to touch. Kids and pets can play around it freely. The overheating protection automatically shuts the heater off if the internal temperature gets too hot. TURBRO heater is CSA certified to be safe for use in North America.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Au9gXKtcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TURBRO","source_asin":"B09MHB5BPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MHB5BPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MHB5BPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
