window.products.push({"id":701440,"name":"Black Gold Chopsticks Reusable Set, 8 1/4 Inches Lightweight, Square Handle 5 Pairs Metal Chopsticks Set with Bag, Premium Stainless Steel Chop Sticks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NPsrRFtWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【SHORT, LIGHTWEIGHT, COMFORTABLE】Weigh about 0.65ounce(18.5gram) per pair, standard length (8 1/4inch / 210mm), these stainless steel chop sticks are light weight in your hands - they don't get tiresome to hold. Well balanced, very comfortable and easy to manipulate. Hollow design prevents them from getting terribly hot. 【BEAUTIFUL COLOR, VERY ATTRACTIVE】These steel chopsticks come as a set of 5 pairs, each pair has black colored handle, from an aesthetic perspective these black-gold metal chopsticks are beautiful, pretty cute reusable chopsticks set for eating. 【NICELY DESIGNED, HIGH QUALITY】Square handles, the food-gripping ends of these metal chopsticks are checkerboard patterned, providing some friction that will help you do a better job of holding food. Made of food grade 304 stainless steel, these chop sticks are more sanitary than wooden or plastic version, great reusable chopsticks set to your dinner table! 【EASY TO STORE, EASY TO CARRY】This is a great sturdy set of reusable chopsticks to use both while at home and while out eating. 5 pairs colorful chopsticks fit into a mesh bag which helps to keep everything together and not rolling around in your drawers, also easy to carry everywhere you go. It's very convenient if your family want to take them on picnics. 【DISHWASHER SAFE, GREAT FOR GIFT GIVING】Stainless steel chopsticks are far more easier to clean than wood or bamboo ones, these are dishwasher safe chopsticks, meanwhile easy enough to hand wash. They look terrific and will last a long time, gift this stylish chop sticks set to your family will save a couple trees!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NPsrRFtWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lazycorner","source_asin":"B088FNG8PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088FNG8PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088FNG8PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":701441,"name":"GEEMBI Quilt Sets with 2 Pillowcases-Theme to My Love. You and Me We Got This Skull Couple THB2290QS1, King Size Coverlet for All Season-Soft Cotton L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":107.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kkwXH+CwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Microfiber, Polyeste Cotton Imported [ 2 IN 1 UNIQUE QUILTS ] Take a look at the design first, your mind will be blown away by the artworks created by our fantastic artists. Every nice piece of work not only a colorful and unique imagine but behind them are stories, themes in life as well as the passion,religious , inspirational and love in each of us. Beyond the drap, duvets and comforters, here are 2 in 1 GEEMBI ARTWORK QUILT. Gifts for Men and Women; Mom and Dad, Valentine's, Mother's and Father's Day; Christmas and New Year. [SELECTION MATERIAL] With two 100% microfiber polyester cotton fabric layers and a fluffy down alternative one in the middle, all these key factors make the blanket SUPER SOFT AND LIGHTWEIGHT, VERY COMFORTABLE for a good night?s sleep, and bring the great slick, silky feel. In additions, the breathable microfiber layers balance the temperature so that the blanket is COOL, NOT TOO HOT when the weather is boiling hot and WARM ENOUGH in the winter. Both functional and decorative [ALL SEASON QUILTS] Unlike duvets and comforters, quilts can be lightweight enough to keep you comfortable in the summer , while remaining on your bed over blankets in the wintertime .This versatility is what keeps quilt enthusiasts coming back. As a part of bedding set or wrap you in while reading a book or just relaxing , enjoy family happy hours while watching favorite TV shows - Perfect for indoor and outdoor use to provide warmth in all seasons, especially for camping and picnic [ DURABLE & EASY-CARE ] Tight stitching or seams on the edging will hold up through washing and won't unravel for longer years to use - Lightweight, durable bedspread sets are perfect for family with pets or kids. .IT'S MACHINE WASHABLE! Simple care for washing microfiber quilted blanket: Wash separately in cold water and then either let them air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and it will fluffier than before. Note: It's better wash microfiber quilts blankets in a mesh laundry bag. [CUSTOMER SERVICE 24/7] 3 sizes are available according to your needs: TWIN: 60x70 inches |QUEEN: 70x80 inches | KING: 91x102 inches + 2 Pillows Perfectly fits the full sized bed and works great for king sized bed while other quilt blankets are just too small. In Business since 1989 - Our Brand is GEEMBI Décor Art and Also guarantees to provide 1-Month return and replacement service & life-time customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kkwXH+CwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEEMBI","source_asin":"B0B87ZFX2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B87ZFX2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B87ZFX2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
