window.products.push({"id":701471,"name":"Classic 8-inch professional chef knife – German style stainless steel razor sharp blade – 6 inch black handle – Top Executive Chef's Knives – for Pro ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611lgFhDKsL._AC_SL1355_.jpg","description":"How is our Chefs knife Superior? It is really sharp! We knew we had the right manufacturing process when our razor sharp stone sharpened edge sliced a tomato with the same ease as a large squash. It is the ideal length. Longer knives produce greater leverage for cutting larger foods like melons and greater force at the heel for chopping harder foods like carrots and nuts. Our handle is a full 6 inches long for added grip flexibility to perform multiple tasks. The perfect handle. Our ergonomic handle is the perfect length and weight to accommodate any grip. Our handle has a full tang which is an absolute must for strength and durability. Our plastic handle will not crack or split like a wooden handle; thus making it an acceptable option for commercial kitchens and restaurant use. The plastic also helps to lower the weight of the handle to reduce fatigue, and provides a better gripping surface than steel. Benefits of our steel. Our 420 series stainless steel has an approximate carbon content of 0.3%, this makes it less hard but more tough than high carbon blades. The extra toughness allows us to sharpen the blade to a 15 degree angle on both sides. It also makes our knife very easy to sharpen at home, meaning even a novice knife user should be able to maintain a razor sharp edge without seeking professional help. Our steel also has superior stain resistance. So much stain resistance that this type of steel is often used in outdoor applications like camping utility knives and even diving knives. It makes a Stunning gift. Our elegant gift box is lined on the inside and makes a beautiful gift and storage option. Sure to impress! Customer satisfaction Guarantee. Our Cuisinelogic 8” chefs knife is backed by a 90 day money back guarantee and a full one year replacement warranty ADD TO YOUR CART TODAY","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611lgFhDKsL._AC_SL1355_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinelogic","source_asin":"B077MVB7YF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077MVB7YF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077MVB7YF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
