window.products.push({"id":701594,"name":"Wooden Coffee Bar Box, Large Farmhouse Coffee Pods Holder for Keurig K-cup Nespresso-Capsule Accessolries, Countertop Station Organizer for Home Displ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dvwe4s7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vintage Decor: Natural wooden texture and farmhouse style add a touch of rustic retro style to your home, the perfect addition to any home decor or makes a great centerpiece to any gathering, offices coffee corner and outdoor party. It will also be great to use as a storage unit on your bathroom to store toilet paper and spray bottles, or a rustic organizer for mail, bills, coupons, letters, cards, and much more! Large Capacity： The box approx. size is 13.4\" x 6\" x 3.5\" . Large capacity to hold all your K-Cups. The organizer holds approx. 100 Nespresso Vertuoline capsules, 70 original capsules, or 24 K-cups pods. Able to store your coffee, tea condiments, canister, candy jars, honey jar, or baking ingredients, helps to keep your table, counters neat organized, and tidy. Tame The Mess: Organize your coffee and tea supplies neatly in your break room or coffee bar with this wood coffee storage station. This storage rack features a large space which can be used for storing supplies such as coffee grounds/beans, small plants, mug, sugar can, coffee cup, coffee partner, tea bag, milk, chocolate sauces, marshmallow, napkins, silverware, straws, creamers and other items. Great Gift Idea: The Perfect gift for that coffee enthusiast in your life! Or anyone who loves to look great while staying organized will appreciate this organizer! Print Phase ”Coffee Time” on one side to brighten your mood and as a reminder for you to take a break, the other side is a blank writable surface for you to mark, ideal DIY for any work or phase you like. Natural and Durable Material: Our coffee station organizer is made of quality wood material, well polished and colored, sturdy and reliable, not easy to break or fade. With a jute rope handle on both sides, making them easy to carry and transport. Smooth and compact on surfaces with no burs or chips, and no pointed corners, available for long-term use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dvwe4s7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKEPAHOK","source_asin":"B09PDNC1PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PDNC1PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PDNC1PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
