window.products.push({"id":701619,"name":"MIFXIN Stretch Loveseat Recliner Cover 2 Seat Recliner Chair Covers Milk Silk Recliner Sofa Covers Double Recliner Slipcovers 6 Pieces Cushion Couch A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MLC-OpftL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️Milk Silk Fabric & Soft Comfortable-This innovative 2-seat stretchable recliner sofa slipcover is crafted from luxurious milk silk fabric. The fabric makes our recline couch covers more stretchy and durable, with good breathability while maintaining gloss. Premium stretch fabric, soft and comfortable, adds a touch of elegance to your home decor. ❤️Full Protection & Perfect Fit-Our milk silk fabric recliner sofa cover feature non-slip elastics to ensuring it won't get stuck, wrinkled, displaced or slipped even after sitting. The elastic straps of each reclining chair covers slipcover provide all-around coverage and slip resistance against everyday stains, scuffs and naughty paintings by kids, as well as cat scratches, dog bites and fur. ❤️Easy to Install-The loveseat recliner cover is easy to install by following our guide photos. Each of our reclining loveseat covers slipcover is marked with an introduction label, 2 covers with \"ARM\" for armrest pieces, 2 covers with \"CENTER BACK OF SEAT\" for seat cushion covers, 6 covers with \"CENTER BACK OF SEAT\" COVER\" for the back piece. Just put it on and tuck the material down around the seat backing and between the armrests. ❤️Easy to Care-There are pockets on the side of the stretch recliner loveseat cover that you can use to store your books or snacks. Whether it's fallen snack crumbs or pet hair, it's easy to wash and manage, so you don't have to worry about sofa cleaning anymore. Washing Tips: Machine Washable, Gently Cycle In Cold Water Separately, Do Not Bleach, Do Not Iron. Mild laundry detergent is recommended. ❤️Save Your Time and Money-The double recliner slipcovers save you money by extending the life of your sofa, protect your sofa cover furniture from daily wear and tear, and give your old furniture a new look. Quickly and easily update the color or fabric of reclining chair slipcovers furniture. We promise to provide unsatisfactory refund service and 24 hours online, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MLC-OpftL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIFXIN","source_asin":"B0BBG6JN4P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBG6JN4P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBG6JN4P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
