window.products.push({"id":701820,"name":"HotShine Mesh Bags Reusable Cotton Mesh Grocery Bags - 100% Cotton | Net Cotton String | Shopping Bag – Eco Market Bag - Tote Bag Vegetable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XM0ZvW+PS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY: Hotshine mesh bags are made from pure cotton. With ultra fine yet strong mesh cotton, these net bags can safely hold all your produce. They would be the best alternative to single-use plastic bags, paper bags, nylon produce bags for shopping purpose. Bio-degradable material, reusable, and comes in zero plastic packaging-makes this product perfectly fulfills your desire for a zero-waste lifestyle. UNIQUE DESIGN: Hotshine mesh grocery bags with 12 inch longer handle ensures easy and comfortable carry for grocery or shopping. You can use them as tote, and you can also hang them on something. These mesh produce bags are lightweight and foldable, which means they are easy and portable to carry with through all your market journey. PREMIUM QUALITY: Hotshine mesh designed tote carrying bag is made with the highest standards of quality, so that they can be highly expanded to hold lots of goods, including long or bulky vegetables or other items. One market bag can support up to 16 Litres or 40 Pounds, makes you free from any worry of their wear and tear with weight-Provides you more convenience while carrying groceries. All these eco bags are natural and chemical free and can machine washable with cold water. VERSATILE: These cotton produce bags are not only for food items, such as fruits, veggie, snacks, but also perfect for storage, such as toys, cosmetics, accessories, travel, office supplies and virtually any form of organizing. Particularly suitable for storing swim gear in the summer and carrying Beach Toys, and related stuff. You wouldn't be dragging sand home in your mesh bag. Perfect for shopping, picnics, tailgates, school, carrying toys etc. STYLISH: These net shopping bags come in different colors; Matching different clothes to show your different styles. You can be stylish even if you go to the grocery market.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XM0ZvW+PS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hotshine","source_asin":"B08NDMMGCT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NDMMGCT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NDMMGCT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
