window.products.push({"id":701962,"name":"LIFERECORD Queen Mattress 14 Inch Memory Foam Mattress with 2 Bonus Pillows, Mattress in A Box, Two-Sided Flippable Use Hybrid Pocket Spring Mattress ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71baW6LsOCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"General Note: Please allow 24 - 72 hours for your Mattress to regain its full shape. Any memory foam will expand faster in a warmer room. In cold temperature, at delivery, your mattress may take a bit longer to return to full sized from its compressed state.The expansion time of the mattress will vary as per the surrounding Memory Foam & Innerspring Hybrid Design: The 14-inch hybrid mattress is designed for all sleepers. It uses layers of memory foam layered on top of supportive individually pocketed springs to achieve a balance between firmness and softness, providing you with the deepest, most restful sleep you've had to date. The mattress can release more pressure points, effectively relieve back and neck pain, and adapt to all sleeping positions. (Buy 1 mattress, get 2 free pillows!) Double-Sided Use In One Mattress: The mattress is medium-firm. It is designed for all sleepers, the inner springs work independently of each other to effectively absorb sound and vibration, and the evenly distributed body weight provides good cushioning pressure release and good bounce. The reversible design of the mattress helps prolong the life of the mattress, and you have the flexibility to choose from a wide range of mattress models to meet all your sleeping needs. Create a Cool & Comfortable Night's Sleep: Made of cool gel AeroFusion memory foam and a breathable fabric quilted cover, the memory foam mattress adapts to the environment, keeping you cool in the summer and warm in the winter. The soft quilted cover provides extra comfort and breathability to help dissipate body heat and increase your depth of sleep, and the special memory foam-based surface provides an ultra-soft, cloud-like feel every night. Fiberglass-Free FR Inner Cover: The inner cover of the mattress provides a safe, effective flame retardant layer around our mattresses without the negative effects of fiberglass. This means no skin irritation or breathing problems for you and your family. Each 14-inch dual memory foam mattress is individually tested to meet the industry's highest requirements and to comply with all regulations set by CertiPUR-US. Mattress In a Box: Each LIFERECORD mattress is included in our 10-year limited warranty. This mattress is professionally compressed, rolled up and shipped in a compact box for convenience. For a better sleeping experience, all you need to do is unpack, cut the wrap and please wait 48-72 hours for the mattress to fully unroll.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71baW6LsOCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFERECORD","source_asin":"B09QMCZ8QH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QMCZ8QH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QMCZ8QH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
