window.products.push({"id":701968,"name":"Aucern Funny Shark Hoodie Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YS2miBJOL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Funny Shark Hoodie Blanket Made With Thick and Warm Flannel Fabric That Won't Fade Or Shrink. Double Sided Plush Design That Offers You Different Soft With One Side of Smooth and Fluffy to the Other. Machine Wash Shark Theme Design: Funny shark hoodie blanket has very kind eyes, cute mouth and fins which are more adorable, interesting and eye-catching. This chubby blanket sweatshirt moves slowly, shakes its fins and keeps saying “I’m really hungry”. When you fully tuck in this wearable blanket, the shark blanket jumps happily and touches its chubby belly contentedly. Premium Material: This super soft wearable blanket is made of warm and thick microfiber fabric which is easy to clean by washing machine in cold water. Moreover, there are variety of colors for your choosing. Choosing different colors to express different feelings when you pretend a shark who is going to eat someone. It is like an adventure which brings you so much fun and makes you obsessed with it. Satisfying Choice: This wearable animal throw has one size fitting all people. You can walk in it without tripping and while the wearable blanket is around you, it doesn’t get in the way of doing things. Excellent fleece blankets keeping warmth from head to toe. Large hood and pocket keep warm for your head and hold what you need. And elastic cuffs allow your hands to move freely. Multiple Occasion: The hooded sweatshirt can be used anywhere and anytime. While you are lounging at home, watching TV, playing games and even going outside in the autumn or winter, this amazing blanket hoodie can bring so much warmth and happiness to adults. Great Gift: This shark flannel blanket is one of the best gifts to have for moms, dads, daughters, sons and any other important people on Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Thanksgiving Day and Christmas. This blanket with sleeves provides ultra soft, comfortable and skin-friendly touch for your beloved. What a sweet gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YS2miBJOL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aucern","source_asin":"B09H5F6BMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-701968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H5F6BMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H5F6BMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
